+// word wrap off and long lines, VS Code makes it as wide as the longest line it has shown). Its
+// right part, buttons included, is then cut off. A probe along the top of the inset tells how
+// much is cut off, and only then do the buttons move left, clear of the minimap and scrollbar.
+// Otherwise they stay put, so they don't wiggle while the editor is resized.
+//
+// The editor doesn't get the mouse wheel events over an inset, so the webview passes them on.
